我们有饼干吗
Do we have any cookies?

363
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:17,964
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

364
00:13:17,964 --> 00:13:19,480
你好啊 老公
Howdy, hubby.

365
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:22,240
在我们开足马力前先吃点零食如何
How about some grub before we turn on the nascar?

366
00:13:23,180 --> 00:13:25,180
说实话 我挺喜欢事情的走向
I'm not gonna lie, I like where this is going.

367
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:28,164
但是 我不确定自己该不该喜欢
But, uh...i'm not sure I'm supposed to.

368
00:13:28,164 --> 00:13:29,460
这不就是你想要的吗
Ain't this what you wanted?

369
00:13:29,460 --> 00:13:30,860
一个完美的美国妻子
The perfect American wife

370
00:13:30,860 --> 00:13:32,520
让你的生活更加便利
to make your life more convenient?

371
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,700
你觉得这是美国口音吗
Do you think that's an American accent?

372
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:35,800
德州口音
From Texas.

373
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:38,860
曼尼告诉我你想让我放弃我的传统
Manny told me that you want me to give up my heritage

374
00:13:38,860 --> 00:13:40,860
这样你就不用在机场排队了
so that you don't have to wait in line at the airport.

375
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,867
我不能再在喝醉后和那孩子聊天了
Oh, I got to stop talking to that kid when I'm drinking.

376
00:13:42,867 --> 00:13:44,220
我不去考试了
Well, I'm not gonna do it.

377
00:13:44,220 --> 00:13:46,940
和你的美国小娇妻告别吧
So say goodbye to your little American wife.

378
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:52,260
天呐 那条热裤真能让我
Man, those shorts really take the sting

379
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:54,820
忘了被骂的痛
out of getting yelled at.

380
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:58,700
我的天呐 那个汉堡太棒了
Oh, my God, that burger was so good,

381
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,860
我感觉就像劈腿了似的
I feel like I just cheated on you.

382
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:02,600
我听见你的呻吟了 我们是不是很差劲
Yeah, I heard the moaning. Are we terrible people?

383
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,560
我觉得不是 听我说
I don't think we are. Look, hear -- hear me out.

384
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:06,601
我们吃了那些汉堡就避免了
By eating those burgers, we denied them

385
00:14:06,601 --> 00:14:09,000
让它们被那些可能来这家餐厅的
from the sort of narrow-minded homophobes

386
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,480
恐同者享受的可能性
that would come to a restaurant like this.

387
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:12,920
好吧 我没太懂 但我喜欢你的结论
Okay, I don't totally follow, but I like where you ended up.

388
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:15,400
我意思就是我们来这里是正确的选择
I-I'm just saying that we did the right thing by coming here,

389
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:16,601
天呐 基友
And I feel like -- oh, god, gays.

390
00:14:16,601 --> 00:14:18,629
我们在这 我们是基友
We're here! We're queer!

391
