超级政治行动委员会捐款的企业
which don't support healthcare coverage for same-sex partners!

393
00:14:25,155 --> 00:14:26,380
原来如此
Oh, right.

394
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:29,020
原来是为这个进行抵制啊
Right. That's why we're boycotting this place.

395
00:14:30,140 --> 00:14:30,580
原来如此
Right.

396
00:14:32,759 --> 00:14:33,700
我们在这 我们是基友
We're here! We're queer!

397
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:35,481
我们该怎么悄悄混进去
How are we supposed to fall in without them noticing?

398
00:14:35,481 --> 00:14:36,472
就跟跳双摇大绳一样
Okay, it's just like double dutch.

399
00:14:36,472 --> 00:14:37,940
找准节奏跳进去就行 快快
Just find the rhythm and jump in. Go, go.

400
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:38,759
-现在 -对
- Right now? - Yeah.

401
00:14:38,759 --> 00:14:39,743
我们在这 我们是基友
We're here! We're queer!

402
00:14:39,743 --> 00:14:42,977
我们不支持为不支持同志享有伴侣医保的
We don't support corporations thatontribute to Super PACs

403
00:14:42,977 --> 00:14:46,673
超级政治行动委员会捐款的企业
which don't support healthcare corage for same-sex partners!

404
00:14:46,673 --> 00:14:48,651
我们在这 我们是基友
We're here! We're queer!

405
00:14:48,651 --> 00:14:52,196
我们不支持为不支持同志享有伴侣医保的
We don't support corporations that contribute to Super PACs

406
00:14:52,196 --> 00:14:53,020
超级政治行动...
which don't support...

407
00:14:53,020 --> 00:14:54,820
你们来了呢
Hey, you came!

408
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:56,740
真是出人所料呢
Well, well, well. What a surprise.

409
00:14:57,060 --> 00:14:58,820
有这什么好意外的
I don't know why this is a surprise.

410
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,380
我们很关心政治
We're very political people.

411
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:02,080
对啊 我们每一天都在热切地
Yes, there's not a week that goes by that we're not

412
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:04,860
关心着基佬社会面临的问题
deeply entrenched in the issues that face our community.

413
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:05,759
热切 那是相当热切
Deeply. Deeply.

414
00:15:05,759 --> 00:15:08,080
-还有这个超级政治行动委员会 -委员会
- And this whole, um, Super PAC thing... - Super PAC.

415
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:09,167
真是太让人气愤了
It's -- it is infuriating.

416
00:15:09,167 --> 00:15:10,658
普里契特先生 您把手机落下了
Mr. Pritchett, you forgot your cellphone inside.

417
00:15:10,658 --> 00:15:12,150
谢谢 谢谢
Thank you. Thank you.

418
00:15:12,397 --> 00:15:13,720
你们来之前
See, uh, before you guys got here,

419
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:14,580
我们走进这家餐厅
we went in there,

420
00:15:14,580 --> 00:15:16,660
让他们退礼物卡的钱
and we demanded a refund for our gift cards.

421
00:15:16,660 --> 00:15:18,893
-我们深入虎穴 -没错
- Yes, we went into the belly of the beast. - So...yes, we did.

422
00:15:18,893 --> 00:15:20,810
-先生 您忘拿打包的菜了 -谢谢
- Sir, you forgot your food to go. - Thank you.

423
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:23,380
-深入虎穴吃饭吗 -不要脸
- And fed your bellies. - How could you?

424
00:15:23,580 --> 00:15:25,800
得了吧 别一副高高在上的样子
Okay, before you get all superior,

425
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:28,134
我们早餐以后啥都没吃
We hadn't eaten since breakfast.

426
00:15:28,134 --> 00:15:29,600
现在才12:45好嘛
It's a quarter to 1:00.

427
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,580
对啊已经12:45了
That's what I'm saying.

428
00:15:30,820 --> 00:15:31,840
听我说 没错
Okay, you know what? Yes.

429
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,300
我们一身正气地走进去
We went in there with the best of intentions,

430
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:36,500
我们是没忍住 可在场的谁没有过啊
and we stumbled, but who amongst us hasn't?

431
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:38,960
-这不就是我们现在争取的吗 -对啊
- And, okay, isn't that what we're fighting for -- - yes.

432
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,580
争取做不完美的人
the freedom to fall short of perfection

433
00:15:40,580 --> 00:15:42,885
而依旧被等同视之的权利
and still be judged by the same standard as everyone else?

434
00:15:42,885 --> 00:15:43,260
-对吧 -谢谢
- That. - Thank you.

435
00:15:43,260 --> 00:15:43,680
不是
No.

436
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:45,660
你没听到口号吗 我们抗议的不是这事
Didn't you hear our chant? It was really quite clear.

437
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:47,259
-口号太长了 -听着
- It's quite long. - You know, look.

438
00:15:47,259 --> 00:15:49,013
-我们想担起社会责任 -没错
- We want to be socially responsible. - We do.

439
00:15:49,013 --> 00:15:50,409
我们想做正确的事
We want to do the right thing.

440
00:15:50,409 --> 00:15:52,520
-但要记得清... -太难了
- But it's hard to keep track... - So hard.

441
00:15:52,520 --> 00:15:54,351
所有我们该喜欢的公司
of all the companies that we like

442
00:15:54,351 --> 00:15:56,400
-和不该喜欢的公司太难了 -不该喜欢的
- and that we don't like. - Don't like.

443
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:58,220
我们就想适应这个世界
We're -- we're just trying to make it in this world,

444
00:15:58,320 --> 00:16:00,760
抚养女儿 让她进足球队
raise our daughter, get her to her soccer game.

445
00:16:00,860 --> 00:16:01,997
你说的该不会是少年足球协会
Not Youth Soccer Federation.

446
00:16:01,997 --> 00:16:03,200
因为如果你说的是少年足球协会
'Cause if it's Youth Soccer Federation --

447
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,728
-我不想知道 -我了个娘啊
- I don't want to know. - Oh, my God!

448
00:16:04,728 --> 00:16:06,740
耻辱 耻辱
You know what? Sh-shame! Shame!

449
00:16:06,740 --> 00:16:08,020
耻辱 奇耻大辱
Shame! Shame on you.

450
00:16:08,340 --> 00:16:10,635
你们比那餐厅里的人好不到哪去
You are no better than the people in that restaurant.

451
00:16:10,635 --> 00:16:12,336
小卡 走了
Come on, Cam let's go.

452
00:16:12,560 --> 00:16:13,440
走
Come on.

453
00:16:14,225 --> 00:16:14,720
他们被唬住了吗
Think they bought it?

454
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:15,780
抬头 别往后看
Keep your head up. Don't look back.

455
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,120
只要肯信 万物成真
Being right is mostly confidence.

456
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:26,580
好了 是我不对
Okay, look. I'm sorry.

457
00:16:27,100 --> 00:16:27,660
我们没事了吧
We good?

458
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:31,300
明显没有
Apparently not.

459
00:16:32,779 --> 00:16:35,040
拿在机场排队当借口
Look, complaining about a line at an airport

460
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:38,400
比承认真实的原因要容易
is easier than admitting the truth about why I want you to become a citizen.

461
00:16:40,380 --> 00:16:41,840
我想我还是很不爽
I guess it still bothers me

462
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,280
你和哈维尔之间千丝万缕的联系
that you have all these ties to Javier.

463
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:44,841
什么联系 你瞎扯些什么
What ties? What are you talking about?

464
00:16:44,841 --> 00:16:46,920
歌洛莉亚·迪尔加多-普里契特
Gloria Delgado-Pritchett.

465
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:49,920
你还留着他的姓 你们都是哥伦比亚人
You still have his last name. You're both Colombians.

466
00:16:50,580 --> 00:16:51,840
我们回国的时候
When you and I come back to the country,

467
00:16:51,900 --> 00:16:53,040
得排不同的队
we have to wait in separate lines

468
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:54,400
就像我们不是一家人
like we're not even in the same family.

469
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:55,660
我也不知道
I don't know.

470
00:16:55,660 --> 00:16:58,520
我猜如果你加入美国籍
I guess I just thought that if you committed to America,

471
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:02,040
你可能就完全属于我了
in some weird way, you'd be recommitting to me.

472
00:17:03,956 --> 00:17:05,500
你从没安静过这么长时间
That's the longest you've ever been quiet,

473
00:17:05,500 --> 00:17:06,800
好吓人
And it's terrifying.

474
00:17:07,340 --> 00:17:09,200
我知道没人问我意见
I know nobody asked for my advice --

475
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:10,120
那你还说些什么
Yet you're talking..

476
00:17:10,700 --> 00:17:11,640
我同意杰
I agree with Jay.

477
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:12,500
听他说
Let's hear him out.

478
00:17:12,660 --> 00:17:13,780
妈 别为了他加入美国籍
Don't do this for him, mom.

479
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:15,060
你怎么这么多话
You're all over the place.

480
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:17,520
你也不该在意爸爸的想法
But you also shouldn't worry about what Dad thinks.

481
00:17:18,320 --> 00:17:19,780
我觉得你应该加入美国籍
I think you should become a citizen

482
00:17:19,780 --> 00:17:22,820
是因为我们还住在旧公寓的时候
because even back when we were alone in our apartment,

483
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:24,580
这就是你想要的
this is what you always wanted.

484
00:17:27,320 --> 00:17:28,680
还记得我们坐在窗边
Remember sitting by the window,

485
00:17:28,742 --> 00:17:32,120
看邻居电视里的《迈阿密风云》重播吗
watching reruns of "Miami Vice" on the neighbor's TV,

486
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:34,461
所有的坏人都被抓住了
and all the bad guys were caught

487
00:17:34,461 --> 00:17:37,180
所有警察都开着那些好车
and all the policemen had those -- those nice cars?

488
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:38,260
我们看的时候就想
We used to watch that

489
00:17:38,260 --> 00:17:41,380
这国家真美好
and think what an amazing country this was.

490
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,320
我调查了一下
Did a little research.

491
00:17:44,700 --> 00:17:46,600
如果杰去享"极乐"之后
If mom isn't a citizen when Jay

492
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:48,200
妈妈还不是正式公民
"moves on to a better place",

493
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:50,860
遗产税的数字就要吓死人了
we could be looking at a pretty hefty estate tax.

494
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:52,920
我不想让人觉得我没人性
I don't want to sound insensitive,

495
00:17:52,964 --> 00:17:55,644
可我实在不能忍受吃不上松露的日子
but I have acquired a real taste for truffles.

496
00:17:56,570 --> 00:17:58,500
好了 孩子们 一共四圈
All right, kids, four laps.

497
00:17:58,500 --> 00:17:59,840
先跑完的人获胜
First one to finish wins.

498
00:18:00,100 --> 00:18:02,720
不是什么高数大物 不过对你们来说
It's not rocket science, unfortunately for you,

499
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:03,940
高数可能反倒更容易
because I think you'd find that easier.

500
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:06,260
紧张吗
You nervous?

501
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:08,119
加油 艾丽克斯 你能行
Come on, Alex! You can do it!

502
00:18:08,119 --> 00:18:10,440
你出生的那天早上我跑了六英里
I ran six miles the morning you were born!

503
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:12,002
你出娘胎就准备好了
You came out of the womb ready for this!

504
00:18:12,002 --> 00:18:15,349
桑杰 你的115个表亲都支持你
Sanjay! Your 115 cousins are rooting for you!

505
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:16,597
你为什么不理我
Why are you ignoring me?

506
00:18:16,597 --> 00:18:17,888
好了 各就各位
All right, on your mark.

507
00:18:18,220 --> 00:18:20,320
听我说 昨天我没想要吓到你
Look. I didn't mean to weird you out yesterday.

508
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:23,040
别说了 我才不会上这些心理战术的当
Stop it. I'm not falling for these little mind games.

509
00:18:23,220 --> 00:18:24,480
-预备 -那不是心理战术
- Get set. - It's not a game.

510
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:25,360
是我的真实想法
It's how I feel.

511
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:26,720
我说了打住 桑杰
I said enough, Sanjay.

512
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:28,400
快跑 桑杰
Run, Sanjay!

513
00:18:28,580 --> 00:18:28,857
怎么回事
What's happening?

514
00:18:28,857 --> 00:18:30,560
他肯定知道什么我们不知道的事
He must know something we don't.

515
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:32,380
别跑了 艾丽克斯 这是个陷阱
Stop running, Alex! It's a trap!

516
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:35,540
你干吗呢
What are you doing?

517
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,300
昨天我说的是实话
I was telling the truth yesterday.

518
00:18:37,980 --> 00:18:39,440
如果能证明我真的喜欢你
I don't care if I lose valedictorian

519
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:41,600
我不在乎丢掉致告别辞的机会
if it'll prove that I really like you.

520
00:18:42,870 --> 00:18:44,180
你是认真的吗
Are -- are you serious?

521
00:18:44,180 --> 00:18:44,700
是的
Yes.

522
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:47,180
请不要笑我
Please don't laugh at me.

523
00:18:47,180 --> 00:18:49,734
露着细腿我觉得好尴尬
I'm -- I'm feeling very exposed with my skinny legs.

524
00:18:52,077 --> 00:18:53,292
我喜欢你的腿
I-I like your legs.

525
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,080
真的
You do?

526
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:58,160
我喜欢你的头发
Well... I love your hair.

527
00:18:58,160 --> 00:18:59,740
还有你的微笑
And your smile.

528
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:01,940
还有别人答错题时
And the way you roll your beautiful brown eyes

529
00:19:01,940 --> 00:19:03,040
你漂亮的棕色眼睛翻白的样子
when someone gets an answer wrong.

530
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,700
我搞不懂怎么回事
I don't understand what's going on.

531
00:19:06,940 --> 00:19:08,020
他为什么不跑
Why isn't he running?

532
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:11,000
我们花了1200元在Skype上了一节博尔特的课呢
We spent $1,200 on a Skype session with Usain Bolt.

533
00:19:11,798 --> 00:19:12,523
感觉我们该接吻了
Uh, I feel like we're about to kiss.

534
00:19:12,705 --> 00:19:13,886
我们该接吻了吗 我还没真的
Are we about to kiss, 'cause I've never really --

535
00:19:15,460 --> 00:19:20,460
我的天 他们在接吻
Oh, my god. They're kissing.

536
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:21,920
桑杰 你在干什么
Sanjay! What are you doing?!

537
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:22,920
离她远点
Get away from her!

538
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,340
好萌啊
Oh, it's so cute.

539
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:26,200
他看上去挺在行的
He seems quite skilled at it.

540
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:27,139
行了 就这样吧
Okay, that's enough.

541
00:19:27,139 --> 00:19:29,670
我觉得 可以低调点
I-I think -- I think we can dial it back.

542
00:19:30,039 --> 00:19:32,600
那么就一起做联合学生代表吧
So, co-valedictorians it is.

543
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:35,080
为了这比赛我错过了家得宝的瓷砖展示会
I missed a tile demo at home depot for this,

544
00:19:35,080 --> 00:19:36,240
你们俩倒好
but good for you.

545
00:19:37,420 --> 00:19:38,520
这片土地上
This is a land

546
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:40,500
生活着众多不同文化背景的人
where people of vastly different cultures

547
00:19:40,500 --> 00:19:43,180
他们因奋斗的意愿和对成功的渴望
are brought together by their willingness to work hard

548
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:45,120
汇集在一起
and their desire to succeed.

549
00:19:45,460 --> 00:19:46,640
我的吻技比你好
I'm a better kisser than you are.

550
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:49,440
开玩笑 姐分分钟碾压你
You're joking, right? I'm actually destroying you.

551
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:53,300
这片土地
This is a land made great

552
00:19:53,300 --> 00:19:56,180
因坚持信仰的人们而伟大
by people standing up for what they believe.

553
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:57,060
你在干什么
What are you doing?

554
00:19:57,470 --> 00:19:59,140
我说啊
Um, you know what?

555
00:19:59,140 --> 00:20:02,039
我决定 我们不能吃这盒扭扭薯条
I have decided that we -- we cannot eat these curly fries.

556
00:20:02,039 --> 00:20:03,837
摇一摇
Ba-ba-ba! Shake it.

557
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:08,399
摇盒子 小卡
The container, Cam.

558
00:20:10,320 --> 00:20:12,940
这是自由的灯塔
This is a beacon of freedom.

559
00:20:13,800 --> 00:20:16,420
欢迎来到美利坚合众国
Welcome to the United States of America.

560
00:20:16,660 --> 00:20:17,460
她是你老婆
That's your wife?

561
00:20:17,560 --> 00:20:18,770
这国家很不错 对吧
Pretty great country, huh?

562
00:20:24,050 --> 00:20:25,290
准备好了吗
Okay. You ready to begin?

563
00:20:26,050 --> 00:20:26,450
准备好了
Yes.

564
00:20:27,930 --> 00:20:29,770
美国政府有几个分支
The United States government has how many branches?

565
00:20:30,410 --> 00:20:31,190
-三个 -正确
- Three. - Correct.

566
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:33,430
美国国旗上的星星是什么颜色的
What color are the stars on the American flag?

567
00:20:33,810 --> 00:20:36,230
白的 不过我觉得我有义务告诉你
White, but I feel like it's my duty to tell you

568
00:20:36,230 --> 00:20:37,870
你背后就有面国旗
that you have a flag right behind you,

569
00:20:37,870 --> 00:20:40,270
我觉得你该换个问题问我
so probably you need to ask me another question.

570
00:20:40,610 --> 00:20:42,090
不用了 恭喜你 你通过了
No need. Congratulations, you passed.

571
00:20:42,530 --> 00:20:44,110
什么 没了吗 才两个问题
What? That's it? Two questions?

572
00:20:44,190 --> 00:20:46,769
还有作弊旗 这样就行了吗
And I have a cheat flag? That's all it takes?

573
00:20:46,769 --> 00:20:48,950
对 你会收到官方信函
Yep, you'll get an official letter in the mail

574
00:20:48,950 --> 00:20:50,430
里面有你宣誓仪式的细节
with the details of your oath ceremony.

575
00:20:50,570 --> 00:20:52,470
你知道我为此花了多长时间学习吗
Do you know how long I've been studying for this?

576
00:20:53,030 --> 00:20:55,510
你把我的成就感都剥夺了
You're robbing me of the feeling of achievement.

577
00:20:55,750 --> 00:20:57,930
再问我一个问题 要难点的
Ask me another question, and a hard one this time.

578
00:20:58,030 --> 00:20:59,790
-可你已经通过了 -快点
- But you already passed -- - Do it.

579
00:21:01,490 --> 00:21:01,890
好吧
Okay.

580
00:21:01,921 --> 00:21:03,952
国会有几个成员
How many Congress members are there?

581
00:21:05,310 --> 00:21:07,410
问迟了 你都说了我已经过了
You know what? It's too late. You've already said that I passed.
